      "text": "Great visiting @MWIPumps in Deerfield Beach, Florida, a family-owned small business celebrating 100 years of American manufacturing and building water pumps used around the world.\n\nI saw firsthand how @POTUS’ Working Family Tax Cuts are helping small businesses reinvest in their workforce, expand overtime opportunities for hardworking employees, and continue exporting American-made products globally. 🇺🇸\n\nThe Trump Administration and @USDOL remain committed to ensuring businesses like @MWIPumps have the tools and support they need to grow and succeed.",
